    "preamble": "Hukumchand Goyal vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 27 November, 2024 Author: Milind Ramesh Phadke Bench: Milind Ramesh Phadke 1 In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At G Wa L I O R Before Hon'Ble Shri Justice Milind Ramesh Phadke On The 27th Of November, 2024 Writ Petition No.6448 of 2014 (Hukumchand Goyal Vs State Of Madhya Pradesh & Ors.) Appearance: (By Shri Sanjay Bahirani - Adovcate For Petitioner) (By Shri B.M. Patel - Government Advocate Respondent/State. ------------------------------------------------------------- Order",
    "facts": "The instant writ petition under Article 226 of the Constitution of India has been filed by the petitioner challenging the legality and validity of the order dated 09.10.2014 whereby by invoking the power of Food Safety Act, 2006, fine amount of Rs.50,000/- has been imposed and in case the fine amount is not deposited within 15 days, then license of the petitioner shall automatically get cancelled. 2.",
